UnitPaymentHubSettle
└── when anyone settles a payment
    ├── given a pending local payment before its deadline
    │   └── it sets Settled, credits the merchant, zeroes the escrow and emits one StatusChanged
    ├── given a pending local payment at its deadline
    │   └── it settles
    ├── given a payment that is not pending
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidTransition
    ├── given a cross chain payment
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_WrongLaneKind
    └── given a local payment after its deadline
        └── it reverts with PaymentHub_DeadlinePassed
